  "thread_ts": "1770945859.212469",
  "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID> done, counted the way your note says. The page: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ruhArnTIFPA9KP_SN6TfXIT3ULwmWGLzRWEoUk3Ed8g/edit (in my Drive, shared with you and Blake)\n\n*Cost to build (Build bucket only)*\n• Domino Delights: $963,374.64\n• ZM: $544,433.44\n• Combo Fighter: $72,685.61\n\n*Brought in (lifetime revenue, REVENUE_DAILY as recorded)*\n• Domino Delights: $12,331.25\n• ZM: $11.99\n• Combo Fighter: left off until its first sales are checked\n\n*What changes on the draft deck*\n• Cost slide: $985K / $609K / $74K → *$963K / $544K / $73K*. Your quick pass was every USD notice. This one keeps only build: marketing comes out (DD $16.4K, ZM $56.5K, CF $1K) and so does company spend ($49.6K plus BGN 1,999 for Martin's laptop).\n• \"Brought in\" slide: *DD ~$12.3K, ZM ~$12*, nothing for Combo Fighter.\n\n*Where my lines differ from the notices* (each one is explained on its Linear issue, and all 22 are moved to Done)\n• Leapblock: $407,944, from their close-out on the 13th (30 wires). The notices show 29 wires; the one missing is their first, 33,290 on 13 Sep 2023, which goes to DD.\n• Lucas: plus $7,525 from 5 Western Union transfers in Jun–Aug 2024. The receipts are in my mail.\n• JPMorgan ***3203, $4,000: our own Chase account (Blake's email on the 13th), so $0.\n• Oleg: $0. The wire came back, and all I have from Payoneer is payment requests, no receipt.\n• PERSON_4419 LLC is Node Media, our UA agency, so it sits in marketing."
 }
